<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=yes">
    <title>English Trainer | Изучай английский с удовольствием</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        :root {
            --bg-1: #eef4ff;
            --bg-2: #f8fbff;
            --ink: #172033;
            --muted: #64748b;
            --primary: #4f46e5;
            --primary-2: #8b5cf6;
            --accent: #14b8a6;
            --warm: #f59e0b;
            --card: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
            --line: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.22);
            --shadow: 0 28px 70px -34px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6);
        }

        body {
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 8% 10%, rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.18), transparent 28rem),
                radial-gradient(circle at 94% 18%, rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.16), transparent 24rem),
                radial-gradient(circle at 78% 88%, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.14), transparent 24rem),
                linear-gradient(145deg, var(--bg-1) 0%, var(--bg-2) 100%);
            color: var(--ink);
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Poppins', 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, 'Roboto', sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
            position: relative;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* декоративные фоновые элементы */
        body::before {
            content: "";
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            background-image:
                linear-gradient(rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.045) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.045) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 52px 52px;
            mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.75), transparent 76%);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        body::after {
            content: "";
            position: fixed;
            right: -90px;
            top: 80px;
            width: 260px;
            height: 260px;
            background: conic-gradient(from 160deg, rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.15), rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.12), rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12), rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.15));
            border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(2px);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        /* ========== БУРГЕР МЕНЮ ========== */
        .burger-btn {
            position: fixed;
            top: 25px;
            left: 25px;
            width: 54px;
            height: 54px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
            border-radius: 18px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
            z-index: 1001;
            box-shadow: 0 16px 34px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.15);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
        }

        .burger-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 38px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.22);
        }

        .burger-btn span {
            display: block;
            width: 26px;
            height: 2.5px;
            background: #1e293b;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        /* затемнение фона при открытом меню */
        .overlay {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.45);
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
            z-index: 1000;
            opacity: 0;
            visibility: hidden;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .overlay.active {
            opacity: 1;
            visibility: visible;
        }

        /* боковое меню */
        .side-menu {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: -320px;
            width: 300px;
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
            backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
            box-shadow: 24px 0 54px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.14);
            z-index: 1002;
            transition: left 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.9, 0.4, 1.1);
            padding: 1.8rem 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            border-right: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.18);
        }

        .side-menu.open { left: 0; }

        .menu-header {
            padding: 0 1.5rem 1.2rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .menu-header h3 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-2));
            background-clip: text;
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }

        .menu-items {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .menu-link {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
            padding: 14px 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #1e293b;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            border-left: 3px solid transparent;
        }

        .menu-link:hover {
            background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.08);
            border-left-color: var(--primary);
            padding-left: 28px;
        }

        .menu-link .menu-icon {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            width: 28px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--line);
            margin: 12px 20px;
        }

        .menu-footer {
            padding-top: 1rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
            margin-top: auto;
        }

        /* главная карточка */
        .glass-card {
            background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.9), rgba(255,255,255,0.72));
            backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
            border-radius: 2.6rem;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            padding: 2rem 2rem 2.5rem;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1220px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
            z-index: 2;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* шапка */
        .hero {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            padding: 1.2rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 2rem;
            background:
                linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.08), rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.08)),
                rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
        }

        .hero-copy {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.55rem;
        }

        .eyebrow {
            width: fit-content;
            background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.1);
            color: #4338ca;
            border: 1px solid rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.14);
            border-radius: 999px;
            padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
            line-height: 0.96;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -0.06em;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #4F46E5 55%, #14b8a6 100%);
            background-clip: text;
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            max-width: 680px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .hero-actions {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.8rem;
            margin-top: 0.35rem;
        }

        .hero-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 0.45rem;
            min-height: 44px;
            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 999px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 800;
            transition: 0.2s ease;
        }

        .hero-btn.primary {
            color: white;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-2));
            box-shadow: 0 18px 28px -18px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.8);
        }

        .hero-btn.secondary {
            color: #334155;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.78);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
        }

        .hero-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }

        .xp-panel {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.96);
            padding: 0.8rem;
            border-radius: 1.4rem;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(92px, 1fr));
            gap: 0.65rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 34px -24px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
        }

        .xp-panel span:nth-child(odd) {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            align-self: end;
        }

        .xp-panel span:nth-child(even) {
            color: #fde68a;
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            background: #020617;
            padding: 0.25rem 0.55rem;
            border-radius: 999px;
            min-width: 54px;
            display: inline-block;
            text-align: center;
        }

        /* секция игр */
        .section-title {
            font-size: 1.55rem;
            font-weight: 850;
            margin: 2rem 0 1.2rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            color: #1e293b;
        }

        .section-title span {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
            width: 42px;
            height: 5px;
            border-radius: 999px;
        }

        .games-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        /* карточки игр и чтения */
        .menu-item {
            background:
                linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.96), rgba(248,250,252,0.9));
            border-radius: 1.8rem;
            padding: 1.35rem;
            min-height: 190px;
            text-align: left;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.28s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.9, 0.4, 1.1);
            box-shadow: 0 14px 32px -24px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75);
            border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 0.65rem;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .menu-item::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 90% 12%, rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.14), transparent 9rem);
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.25s ease;
        }

        .menu-item::after {
            content: "→";
            position: absolute;
            right: 1.1rem;
            bottom: 1rem;
            color: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.7);
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            transform: translateX(-6px);
            opacity: 0;
            transition: 0.25s ease;
        }

        .menu-item:hover {
            transform: translateY(-7px);
            box-shadow: 0 30px 44px -26px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.45);
            border-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
        }

        .menu-item:hover::before,
        .menu-item:hover::after {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateX(0);
        }

        .menu-icon {
            width: 58px;
            height: 58px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 2.15rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(79,70,229,0.12), rgba(20,184,166,0.1));
            filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 10px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08));
        }

        .menu-title {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 850;
            color: #172033;
        }

        .menu-desc {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.45;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .menu-chip {
            margin-top: auto;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.35rem;
            width: fit-content;
            color: #4338ca;
            background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.09);
            border: 1px solid rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.12);
            border-radius: 999px;
            padding: 0.32rem 0.65rem;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        /* Секция Reading Room (отдельное пространство) */
        .reading-section {
            margin-top: 3rem;
            background:
                linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1), rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.06)),
                rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.62);
            border-radius: 2rem;
            padding: 1.5rem 1.8rem;
            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.22);
            transition: all 0.3s;
            box-shadow: 0 18px 38px -34px rgba(76, 29, 149, 0.6);
        }

        .reading-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        }

        .reading-header h2 {
            font-size: 1.7rem;
            font-weight: 850;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6D28D9, #14b8a6);
            background-clip: text;
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }

        .feature-badge {
            background: rgba(109, 40, 217, 0.1);
            color: #6D28D9;
            border: 1px solid rgba(109, 40, 217, 0.14);
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .reading-card {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 1.4rem;
            align-items: stretch;
        }

        .reading-info {
            flex: 2;
            min-width: 240px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 1.5rem;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 16px 28px -22px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.45);
        }

        .reading-info p {
            margin: 1rem 0;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #334155;
        }

        .feature-list {
            list-style: none;
            margin: 1rem 0;
        }

        .feature-list li {
            margin: 12px 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .feature-list li::before { content: "✨"; }

        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-2), #6D28D9);
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-top: 12px;
            transition: 0.2s;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 22px -14px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.85);
        }

        .cta-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 16px 26px -16px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.95);
        }

        .book-preview {
            flex: 1.2;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #f8fafc, #ffffff);
            border-radius: 1.5rem;
            padding: 1.2rem;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
        }

        .book-cover {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .book-title {
            font-weight: 800;
            margin: 8px 0;
        }

        .demo-translate {
            background: #f1f5f9;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }

        /* вдохновляющее сообщение */
        .inspire-message {
            margin-top: 2.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.76);
            border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
            padding: 0.75rem 1.1rem;
            border-radius: 60px;
            width: fit-content;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
            color: #334155;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 24px -22px rgba(15,23,42,0.45);
        }


        /* регистрация и вход */
        .auth-card {
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            background:
                linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.1), rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.09)),
                rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
            border: 1px solid rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.14);
            border-radius: 2rem;
            padding: 1.35rem;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
            gap: 1.2rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .auth-copy { text-align: left; }

        .auth-copy h2 {
            color: #1e293b;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .auth-copy p {
            color: #475569;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .auth-form {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
            border-radius: 1.5rem;
            padding: 1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 14px 26px -20px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.45);
        }

        .auth-tabs {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
        }

        .auth-tab,
        .auth-submit,
        .logout-btn {
            border: 0;
            border-radius: 999px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 800;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        .auth-tab {
            background: #e2e8f0;
            color: #334155;
            padding: 0.65rem 0.8rem;
        }

        .auth-tab.active {
            background: #4F46E5;
            color: white;
        }

        .auth-field {
            width: 100%;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 1rem;
            padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
            font: inherit;
            outline: none;
        }

        .auth-field:focus {
            border-color: #4F46E5;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.12);
        }

        .auth-submit {
            width: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4F46E5, #8B5CF6);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.25);
        }

        .auth-submit:hover,
        .logout-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }

        .auth-status {
            min-height: 1.4rem;
            margin-top: 0.75rem;
            color: #475569;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .auth-status.success { color: #059669; }
        .auth-status.error { color: #dc2626; }

        .user-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 1.5rem;
            padding: 1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 22px -14px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.35);
            text-align: left;
        }

        .user-card strong {
            display: block;
            color: #1e293b;
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        }

        .user-card span {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .logout-btn {
            margin-top: 0.9rem;
            background: #ef4444;
            color: white;
            padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 780px) {
            body { padding: 0.85rem; }
            .burger-btn { top: 14px; left: 14px; width: 48px; height: 48px; }
            .glass-card { padding: 1rem; border-radius: 1.6rem; }
            .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 1.5rem; margin-top: 3.6rem; }
            h1 { font-size: 2.25rem; letter-spacing: -0.04em; }
            .hero-subtitle { font-size: 0.98rem; }
            .xp-panel { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
            .section-title { font-size: 1.35rem; }
            .games-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .menu-item { min-height: auto; }
            .reading-section { padding: 1rem; border-radius: 1.5rem; }
            .reading-header { align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; }
            .auth-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- Бургер кнопка -->
<div class="burger-btn" id="burgerBtn">
    <span></span>
    <span></span>
    <span></span>
</div>

<!-- Затемнение -->
<div class="overlay" id="overlay"></div>

<!-- Боковое меню навигации -->
<nav class="side-menu" id="sideMenu">
    <div class="menu-header">
        <h3>📚 English Trainer</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="menu-items">
        <a href="#" class="menu-link" id="navHome">
            <span class="menu-icon">🏠</span>
            <span>Главная</span>
        </a>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <a href="#" class="menu-link" id="navAuth">
            <span class="menu-icon">🔐</span>
            <span>Регистрация / Вход</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/profile" class="menu-link">
            <span class="menu-icon">👤</span>
            <span>Профиль</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/dictionary" class="menu-link">
            <span class="menu-icon">📘</span>
            <span>Мой словарь</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/review" class="menu-link">
            <span class="menu-icon">🔁</span>
            <span>Повторение</span>
        </a>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <a href="#" class="menu-link" id="navGames">
            <span class="menu-icon">🎮</span>
            <span>Игры</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/reader" class="menu-link" id="navReading">
            <span class="menu-icon">📖</span>
            <span>Чтение книг</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/book-trial" class="menu-link">
            <span class="menu-icon">🧠</span>
            <span>Book Trial AI</span>
        </a>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <a href="#" class="menu-link" id="navAbout">
            <span class="menu-icon">ℹ️</span>
            <span>О нас</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="menu-link" id="navCourses">
            <span class="menu-icon">🎓</span>
            <span>Купить курсы</span>
        </a>
    </div>
    <div class="menu-footer">
        <div class="menu-link" style="opacity:0.7;">
            <span class="menu-icon">⚡</span>
            <span>v2.0 — Учись играя</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</nav>

<div class="glass-card">
    <div class="hero">
        <div class="hero-copy">
            <div class="eyebrow">Учись играя</div>
            <h1>English Trainer</h1>
            <p class="hero-subtitle">Тренируй слова, грамматику, чтение и произношение в одном уютном пространстве — без лишних настроек на старте.</p>
